  "goodToKnow": "Theologisch means theological: eine theologische Fakultät, theologische Fragen. Die Theologie is theology, and der Theologe (die Theologin) a theologian, a weak noun: den Theologen. Many German state universities have both katholische and evangelische Theologie faculties, funded through agreements with the churches. Germany's theological tradition includes Luther, Dietrich Bonhoeffer and Joseph Ratzinger (Pope Benedict XVI). From Greek theos (god)."
